{
  "name": "easy-gpu",
  "displayName": "Easy GPU",
  "description": "监控远程 SSH 服务器的 GPU / CPU / 内存状态（gpustat 风格面板），支持各用户显存占用统计。",
  "version": "1.0.0",
  "publisher": "yourkwan",
  "license": "MIT",
  "repository": {
    "type": "git",
    "url": "https://github.com/yourkwan/easy-gpu"
  },
  "engines": {
    "vscode": "^1.74.0"
  },
  "categories": [
    "Other",
    "Visualization"
  ],
  "keywords": [
    "gpu",
    "gpustat",
    "nvidia",
    "ssh",
    "monitor"
  ],
  "extensionKind": [
    "ui",
    "workspace"
  ],
  "main": "./out/extension.js",
  "activationEvents": [
    "onStartupFinished"
  ],
  "contributes": {
    "commands": [
      {
        "command": "easy-gpu.openDashboard",
        "title": "打开监控面板",
        "category": "Easy GPU"
      },
      {
        "command": "easy-gpu.selectHost",
        "title": "选择 SSH 服务器",
        "category": "Easy GPU"
      },
      {
        "command": "easy-gpu.refreshNow",
        "title": "立即刷新",
        "category": "Easy GPU"
      },
      {
        "command": "easy-gpu.setPassword",
        "title": "设置 SSH 密码",
        "category": "Easy GPU"
      },
      {
        "command": "easy-gpu.forgetPassword",
        "title": "清除已保存的密码 / 私钥口令",
        "category": "Easy GPU"
      },
      {
        "command": "easy-gpu.selectPrivateKey",
        "title": "选择私钥文件（登录方式）",
        "category": "Easy GPU"
      }
    ],
    "configuration": {
      "title": "Easy GPU",
      "properties": {
        "easy-gpu.host": {
          "type": "string",
          "default": "",
          "markdownDescription": "远程服务器的 SSH 主机：可以是 `~/.ssh/config` 中的别名，或 `user@host`。扩展直接复用系统 ssh 与密钥，不会保存任何密码。"
        },
        "easy-gpu.refreshInterval": {
          "type": "number",
          "default": 5,
          "minimum": 2,
          "maximum": 600,
          "markdownDescription": "自动刷新间隔（秒）。"
        },
        "easy-gpu.sshExtraArgs": {
          "type": "array",
          "items": {
            "type": "string"
          },
          "default": [],
          "markdownDescription": "传给系统 `ssh` 的额外参数，例如 `[\"-p\", \"2222\"]`。"
        },
        "easy-gpu.showStatusBar": {
          "type": "boolean",
          "default": true,
          "markdownDescription": "在状态栏显示 GPU / CPU / 内存概览。"
        },
        "easy-gpu.connectionMode": {
          "type": "string",
          "enum": [
            "auto",
            "systemSsh",
            "builtin"
          ],
          "default": "auto",
          "markdownEnumDescriptions": [
            "优先使用系统 ssh（复用 ~/.ssh/config、密钥、agent）；认证失败时自动回退到内置客户端并提示输入密码。",
            "只使用系统 ssh，仅支持免密（密钥 / ssh-agent）登录。",
            "只使用内置 SSH 客户端：支持密码、私钥与 ssh-agent，不依赖本机 OpenSSH。"
          ],
          "markdownDescription": "连接远程服务器的方式。"
        },
        "easy-gpu.rememberPassword": {
          "type": "boolean",
          "default": true,
          "markdownDescription": "密码 / 私钥口令验证成功后，保存到系统钥匙串（VS Code SecretStorage），下次自动连接；关闭后只在输入时使用一次。"
        },
        "easy-gpu.privateKeyPath": {
          "type": "string",
          "default": "",
          "markdownDescription": "指定登录用的私钥文件（可选），支持 `~`。留空则使用 `~/.ssh/config` 的 `IdentityFile` 与 `~/.ssh/id_*` 默认密钥。加密私钥会提示输入口令；PuTTY 的 `.ppk` 格式需先转成 OpenSSH 格式。"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  "scripts": {
    "compile": "tsc -p ./",
    "watch": "tsc -w -p ./",
    "package": "vsce package"
  },
  "dependencies": {
    "ssh2": "^1.17.0"
  },
  "devDependencies": {
    "@types/node": "^20.11.30",
    "@types/ssh2": "^1.15.6",
    "@types/vscode": "^1.74.0",
    "@vscode/vsce": "^3.2.1",
    "typescript": "^5.4.5"
  }
}
